   "id": "bb-216-scheme",
   "h": "Post-Partum Fever scheme (Blackbook)",
   "html": "<div class=\"flow\" data-flow=\"b216a\"></div><p><u>6 W’s for Causes of PPF</u></p><ul><li><b>Wind</b>: pneumonia, atelectasis</li><li><b>Water</b>: UTI</li><li><b>“Woobies”</b>: mastitis</li><li><b>Womb</b></li><li><b>Wound</b>: cellulitis, vulvas incision, endomyometritis</li><li><b>Walking</b>: DVT</li></ul><ul><li><b>&lt; 6 Weeks Post-Partum</b><ul><li><b>Infectious</b><ul><li><b>Infectious — Respiratory</b><ul><li>Pneumonia</li></ul></li><li><b>Infectious — Uterine</b><ul><li>Endometritis</li><li>Retained Products of Conception</li></ul></li><li><b>Infectious — Breasts</b><ul><li>Mastitis</li><li>Abscess</li></ul></li><li><b>Infectious — Urinary</b><ul><li>UTI</li><li>Pyelonephritis</li></ul></li><li><b>Infectious — Wound</b><ul><li>Cesarean Incision</li><li>Vaginal Laceration</li><li>Episiotomy</li><li>Abscess/Hematoma</li></ul></li></ul></li><li><b>Non-Infectious</b><ul><li><b>Non-Infectious — Respiratory</b><ul><li>Atelectasis</li><li>PE</li></ul></li><li><b>Non-Infectious — Uterine</b></li><li><b>Non-Infectious — Thrombotic</b><ul><li>DVT</li><li>Septic Pelvic Thrombophlebitis</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul>"
  }
